  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Sierbahnn",
      "content": "Bafflingly bad greenscreen\r\nThe movie isn't any good. It is a cheap \"The Shallows\" (American version, not the Chinese one), but with two people stuck on a rock rather than one, and an Orca rather than a Great white shark.\r\n\r\nThis movie, however, does have bafflingly poor greenscreen, which was never necessary. You could easily have done those shots outdoors, in a pool on a soundstage, or even with a painted backdrop. But they went with a greenscreen, and sis so poorly.\r\n\r\nThe characters are unlikable, the plot silly, the visuals poor, and there is simply very little good to say out it. I would swim elsewhere.",
      "rating": 3,
      "createdAt": "2026-05-27T15:18:35Z"
    }
  ],
